# Clifftop Lookout (1/2 Reach, {2}{G}): "When this creature enters, reveal cards from the top of your library until you
# reveal a land card. Put that card onto the battlefield tapped and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order"
# (CR 701.20, 401.4). Three Moxen pay for it on turn 1. Ornithopter is revealed, then the Island, which enters tapped; the
# Ornithopter goes to the bottom, under the cards that were never revealed (the second Island is not touched), and the Lookout
